      "version": "2.0",
      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "filepath": "",
        "lang": "None",
        "etext": "MODULAR-SYNTH / AURORA GLASS BELLS\n\nPlay 2-8 MIDI notes for a shimmering FM bell bed.\n8-channel Reuse MIDI drives individual pitches\nand ADSR gates. FM -> VCA -> StateFilter;\nLP/BP colors split into stereo Echo L/R.\n\nCHANCE HOLD free-runs at 0.25 Hz / 65%;\nSMOOTH goes through DualVCA A (24% gain)\nto filter cutoff: bounded +/-1.2 V drift.\nMacro8 scenes A-D: Dawn, Prism, Halo, Dusk.\nMacro outputs: Index, Resonance, Wet,\nTime and Feedback. All ranges unipolar.\n\nNo HostTime or sync; keep levels low.\nGraph/source-validated, host audio untested.\n",
        "width": 31
      },
      "pos": [130, 0]
    }
